<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS1" title="In 6.2 Cross-model Stylistic Refinement ‣ 6 Stage 2: Cross-model Refinement ‣ SMARTER: A Data-efficient Framework to Improve Toxicity Detection with Explanation via Self-augmenting Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2.1 </span>Cross-model Refinement Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS1.Px1" title="In 6.2.1 Cross-model Refinement Results ‣ 6.2 Cross-model Stylistic Refinement ‣ 6 Stage 2: Cross-model Refinement ‣ SMARTER: A Data-efficient Framework to Improve Toxicity Detection with Explanation via Self-augmenting Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Cross-model training enhances T5 while impairing Llama.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS2" title="In 6.2 Cross-model Stylistic Refinement ‣ 6 Stage 2: Cross-model Refinement ‣ SMARTER: A Data-efficient Framework to Improve Toxicity Detection with Explanation via Self-augmenting Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2.2 </span>Stylistic Analysis</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsubsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS2.SSS2.Px1" title="In 6.2.2 Stylistic Analysis ‣ 6.2 Cross-model Stylistic Refinement ‣ 6 Stage 2: Cross-model Refinement ‣ SMARTER: A Data-efficient Framework to Improve Toxicity Detection with Explanation via Self-augmenting Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Cross-model explanations improve weak categories.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In SMARTER: A Data-efficient Framework to Improve Toxicity Detection with Explanation via Self-augmenting Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Discussion and Conclusion</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
