<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 8 Limitations ‣ SMARTER: A Data-efficient Framework to Improve Toxicity Detection with Explanation via Self-augmenting Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Model selection</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S8.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 8 Limitations ‣ SMARTER: A Data-efficient Framework to Improve Toxicity Detection with Explanation via Self-augmenting Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Limited scope of human validation</span></a></li>
