<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>A sample post in <span id="A6.F10.sf1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Latent Hate</span> with gold label. Offensive content partially redacted.</figcaption>
