<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span> Examples of a post in <span id="A6.F11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Implicit Hate</span> with gold label, along with the explanations of the <span id="A6.F11.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">T5</span> and <span id="A6.F11.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Llama</span> self-augmented variants at K=128, and the cross-trained model using all K=256 in total. In this example, we also observe the cross-pollination of style in terms of verbosity, albeit to a lesser degree, but all models classify correctly. </figcaption>
</figure>
